      "bottomRightX": 609,
      "bottomRightY": 125,
      "content": "Many schools have Career Advisors to help school-leavers plan their careers.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 140,
      "bottomRightX": 604,
      "bottomRightY": 194,
      "content": "**Listen to how the school-leaver speaks. How does he feel? Answer the questions in Workbook activities A and B. Listen and repeat the conversation.**",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 204,
      "bottomRightX": 151,
      "bottomRightY": 233,
      "content": "Offer Help\nask for advice",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 204,
      "bottomRightX": 458,
      "bottomRightY": 308,
      "content": "**Career Advisor:** Now, how can I help you?\n**School-leaver:** Well, it's just that ... I don't know ... I need your advice. I've no idea what I want to do after I leave school. I've been thinking about it but ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 314,
      "bottomRightX": 166,
      "bottomRightY": 329,
      "content": "Ask about family",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 306,
      "bottomRightX": 446,
      "bottomRightY": 373,
      "content": "**Career Advisor:** What do your parents do?\n**School-leaver:** My father's an engineer and my mother's a Maths teacher.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 369,
      "bottomRightX": 142,
      "bottomRightY": 384,
      "content": "Give advice",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 372,
      "bottomRightX": 449,
      "bottomRightY": 407,
      "content": "**Career Advisor:** Then why not train to be a Maths teacher?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 83,
      "topLeftY": 397,
      "bottomRightX": 169,
      "bottomRightY": 411,
      "content": "Turn down advice",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 406,
      "bottomRightX": 450,
      "bottomRightY": 439,
      "content": "**School-leaver:** I'm no good at Maths. I'm hopeless at it.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 195,
      "topLeftY": 439,
      "bottomRightX": 428,
      "bottomRightY": 457,
